# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image (npm ci, vite build).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/npm-debug.log
**/*.log
.git
**/.gitignore
# Secrets and runtime data never go into the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
data
**/uploads
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
docs
.github
*.md
# Modules distributed as packages (docs/module-packages.md): built with `make module`,
# installed from their zip — not part of the core image.
src/backend/modules/masterplan
src/frontend/src/modules/masterplan
src/backend/modules/qr
src/frontend/src/modules/qr
